        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-4804, Traditional Tapered Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFinally, a traditional pull that is not weighted down by the frills of the old world. The Tapered Appliance Pull has a sleekness that is not often found in classic designs and it is this chic style that propels its classic beauty into the contemporary. It has a 12 inch center to center, making it useful not only as an appliance pull, but as a pull for almost any type of door. Available in 5 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/tapered-cabinet-door-handle-rk-international-cp-1622\"><b>Tapered Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AP-PH-4804 12 Inch Plain Tapered Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 14-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
